Liu Bei and Sun Quan formed an alliance.

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:12.290
With Cao Cao's army having advanced southward,

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:15.830
<b>Cao</b>

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:15.830
<b>Yangtze River</b>

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:15.830
<b>Liu                               Sun</b>

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:15.040
