00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.080
It later came to be called the "Battle of Red Cliffs."

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:19.540
<b>RED</b>

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:19.540
<b>CLIFFS</b>

