00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:23.830
that nearly blanketed the Yangtze.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.630
The opposing allied army was a mere
tenth the size of Cao Cao's.

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:33.130
The Battle of Red Cliffs had begun with an
overwhelming disparity of military force.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.250
<b>Sun                                           Liu</b>

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.250
<b>Cao                                        Cao</b>

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.250
<b>Cao</b>

