generated a bit of buzz at clubs and festivals?

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:09.790
You really okay with this?

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:12.170
You bet! If anything, it's overdue!

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:16.290
Sorry, I knew you were suffering, Nanami.

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:19.210
