00:11:04.710 --> 00:11:05.540
Yay!

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:06.540
Whoo!

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:07.750
That was awesome.

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:10.040
Lady Nanami, I'll always be your fan!

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:21.040
Are you satisfied with a select few
appreciating your music?

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:24.830
If so, you'll go back to being a band that can't sell.

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:27.540
In that situation...

00:11:27.960 --> 00:11:31.460
In that situation, do you think
you can make a career in music?!

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:37.040
You not might like it, but THIS is the real Azalea.

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:40.170
This is the style of music we want to play.

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:42.920
That kind of naïve thinking won't cut it in the real world!

00:11:43.380 --> 00:11:47.920
Karasawa, even so, we are going to keep making music.

