00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:07.710
We made it in time!

00:13:07.710 --> 00:13:09.830
I heard Azalea was playing, so I rushed right over!

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:12.290
Yeah! Hurry on over to 109!

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:14.170
Wazzup!

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:15.580
As of today, consider me an Azalea fan!

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:17.000
I like the cool Azalea as much as the cute one!

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:20.250
Azalea has always been Azalea at heart, though.

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:21.580
You done already?!

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:22.960
We want an encore!

00:13:22.960 --> 00:13:24.000
I missed the concert!

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:25.880
Won't you release a live recording?!

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:27.330
What in the...

