00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:28.920
I once made a wish.

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:34.670
It was to be reborn in a peaceful world
in which my life did not revolve around war.

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:40.170
And now, I have been able to live in this place,
experience the magnificence of music,

00:19:40.170 --> 00:19:43.290
and meet a master who is brimming with talent.

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:46.380
